# This app no longer reads AI provider API keys from the server environment.
# Each visitor enters their own Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini API key directly in the
# app's UI (top-right "AI provider" control). Their key is stored only in
# their own browser's localStorage and sent straight through to the AI
# provider per-request — it is never stored on this server.
